# Gold Forever's auction house panel, which the core loads when the auction house opens (Kernel/OnDemand.lua).
# Its interface and version are those of the core's TOC of the same name (tests/toc_test.lua).
# Retail. Patch 12.1.5 is interface 120105 (warcraft.wiki.gg, "Getting the current interface number",
# 2026-10-22); the 12.0 numbers stay for players a patch behind. After a retail patch, add the number
# /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo()) prints, or the client calls the addon out of date.
## Interface: 120105, 120100, 120007, 120005, 120001, 120000
## Title: Gold Forever Auctions
## Notes: Gold Forever's auction house panel. Gold Forever loads it when the auction house opens.
## Version: 0.16.1
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\GoldForever\Media\Icon.tga
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## Dependencies: GoldForever

Kernel\Namespace.lua
Surfaces\AuctionWaits.lua
Tools\AuctionBlizzard.lua
Tools\AuctionBooks.lua
Surfaces\AuctionScanTab.lua
Surfaces\AuctionSell.lua
Surfaces\AuctionBuy.lua
Surfaces\AuctionCancel.lua
Surfaces\AuctionBank.lua
Surfaces\AuctionPanel.lua
